"title\":\"Bridget Jones's Diary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/olMTi7uCaec9Yr3Ar07D2SIja1G.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9rSpxsMhG1FnFtUDdvSAXdtLtb3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bridget Jones is an average woman struggling against expectations. As a New Year's resolution, Bridget decides to take control of her life, starting by keeping a diary in which she will always tell the complete truth. Her charming boss takes an interest in her, and she cannot stop running into a rather disagreeable acquaintance whom Bridget cannot help finding quietly attractive.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":496,\"title\":\"Borat: Cultural Learnings of America for Make Benefit Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7g9kBHMN2KTr5KUf8aen187Mdn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mEagEZkyUp18shDqX05w4zxTnEM.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kazakh journalist Borat Sagdiyev travels to America to make a documentary. As he zigzags across the nation, Borat meets real people in real situations with hysterical consequences. His backwards behavior generates strong reactions around him exposing prejudices and hypocrisies in American culture.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6557,\"title\":\"27 Dresses\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rEfourJfgEyKiewwH8ZkUYt9AqE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/esArWR9sImBpEgq3sHCPyP5mcfd.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Altruistic Jane finds herself facing her worst nightmare as her younger sister announces her engagement to the man Jane secretly adores.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":102207,\"title\":\"HOUBA! On the Trail of the Marsupilami\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yn3ydorp7YigPcnEZgNMvdNHPaF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xD9hhKEt0DubqzZ2nBTxQlixewi.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When reporter Dan Geraldo arrives in Palombia to hunt for a scoop, he never suspects that he is about to make an incredible discovery... With his resourceful local guide Pablito, D an has one surprise after another during a thrilling adventure that allows him to bring the world some spectacular news: the Marsupilami, a mythical and mischievous animal, really does exist! You too will believe in furry tails!\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4226,\"title\":\"Shriek If You Know What I Did Last Friday the 13th\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m0jr23r30h8DUrX3kIu7rO3NIQp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wjOC016WdJd6xCphiebKNYDuq4Q.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In this horror parody, a masked serial killer menaces the town of Bulimia Falls with various sharp objects. Attention-seeking television personality Hagitha Utslay is soon on the scene, reporting on the ever-growing body count. Former mall security guard Doughy shows up to protect the teenage population, but he's clearly not much help, allowing the murderer to pick off even more hapless kids as numerous scary movies are referenced.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11847,\"title\":\"The Accidental Spy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fPW4Qn9wm82uOexHMB3TC8x6lRU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2vQfPfzcFylZdPUBN6yNRusqe5X.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A fun-filled story about an ordinary guy about to kick into an action-packed adventure. Jackie Chan plays a bored and unsuccessful salesman who never thought his life would amount to anything. All that changes one day when he becomes an instant hero by foiling an attempted bank robbery.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":284296,\"title\":\"Top Five\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hNFhzLpg3A34p9qFXXIBJfQIMoK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AfsLMtqkFGtlCeCGZNsVuWlTiqF.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Though he began in stand-up comedy, Andre Allen hit the big-time as the star of a trilogy of action-comedies about a talking bear but now he wants to be taken seriously. His passion project about the Haitian Revolution, a movie called Uprize, was panned by the NY Times film critic. A couple days before the wedding to his reality star fiancée, he's forced to spend the day with Chelsea Brown, a profile writer for the New York Times. Unexpectedly, he opens up to her, and as they wind their way across New York, he tries to get back in touch with his comedic roots.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14406,\"title\":\"Mariage chez les Bodin's\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tHwHyMVbZ86j4F1N2L1eaaAMzwr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/od2EZtDNm6PluAzcsxknPXyvOwn.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Nous sommes dans un coin de France reculé... très reculé.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14078,\"title\":\"Morgan Pålsson - World Reporter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a9vcYce628ryKvzwMT9JKNEtrlA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5anmzoXQVusVeT9Mpa6diylVA36.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Foreign correspondent Morgan Pålsson and his photographer Robert Flycht are sent on assignment to an unknown North African country – Matóbo. The assignment is to cover the country's elections, but instead a military coup breaks out and Morgan turns out to be the only foreign journalist on the scene. This is his chance to show what he's made of.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9784,\"title\":\"Man About Town\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eorqaoGq2rU923VGJE5ZmRdWfLR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AsTFKL3Gl7hsmtMfUlPGtBOuhe8.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A top Hollywood talent agent finds his cushy existence threatened when he discovers that his wife is cheating on him and that his journal has been swiped by a reporter out to bring him down.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"B2QYxN5FDeg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3rZQ5WEFuEg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3PVDpp1v2dw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}